":"In the park","pt":"A","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.b1f0dd","j":"mcq","s":"Which day does Daniel like best?","p":["Saturday","Monday","Sunday","Wednesday"],"a":"Saturday","pt":"A","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.759534","j":"mcq","s":"Who lives in the old house?","p":["The writer's friend","Grandpa","The writer's teacher","Grandma"],"a":"Grandma","pt":"B","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.13751b","j":"mcq","s":"How many bedrooms are there?","p":["Two","One","Four","Three"],"a":"Three","pt":"B","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.21caec","j":"mcq","s":"Where is the garden?","p":["In the kitchen","In front of the house","Behind the house","Next to the school"],"a":"Behind the house","pt":"B","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.c46192","j":"mcq","s":"What tree is in the garden?","p":["A banana tree","A coconut tree","An apple tree","A mango tree"],"a":"A mango tree","pt":"B","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.0a1b2a","j":"mcq","s":"What shape is Robo's head?","p":["Triangle","Square","Star","Round"],"a":"Square","pt":"C","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.65419a","j":"mcq","s":"What can Robo do?","p":["Walk and talk","Swim and fly","Sing and sleep","Cook and eat"],"a":"Walk and talk","pt":"C","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.f43a43","j":"mcq","s":"What can't Robo do?","p":["Clean","Walk","Swim","Talk"],"a":"Swim","pt":"C","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.26aa46","j":"mcq","s":"How does Robo help?","p":["He cooks dinner.","He does homework.","He washes the car.","He cleans the room."],"a":"He cleans the room.","pt":"C","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.8ddcca","j":"mcq","s":"Where are Ali and Sara?","p":["At school","At the beach","At the shop","At home"],"a":"At the beach","pt":"D","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.715aa0","j":"mcq","s":"What colour is the bucket?","p":["Red","Blue","Green","Yellow"],"a":"Blue","pt":"D","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.bcaf4e","j":"mcq","s":"What is Ali doing?","p":["Reading","Sleeping","Making a sandcastle","Swimming"],"a":"Making a sandcastle","pt":"D","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.5931ce","j":"mcq","s":"Where is their mother?","p":["In the sea","On a boat","In the car","Under an umbrella"],"a":"Under an umbrella","pt":"D","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.55a3db","j":"mcq","s":"What is Aina wearing?","p":["A red jacket","A blue skirt","A green shirt","A pink dress"],"a":"A pink dress","pt":"E","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.17f415","j":"mcq","s":"What colour are Aina's shoes?","p":["White","Pink","Black","Brown"],"a":"White","pt":"E","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.a53892","j":"mcq","s":"Who is Amir?","p":["Aina's father","Aina's uncle","Aina's friend","Aina's brother"],"a":"Aina's brother","pt":"E","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.9b0412","j":"mcq","s":"Who do they visit?","p":["Their teacher","Their friends","Their grandparents","Their neighbours"],"a":"Their grandparents","pt":"E","aras":2},{"id":"t2-bi-8.5fc1cf","j":"bs","s":"Daniel reads books on Sundays.","a":"Betul","pt":"A","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-bi-8.d92760","j":"bs","s":"The kitchen is small.","a":"Salah","pt":"B","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-bi-8.d00e94","j":"bs","s":"Robo has got two short arms.","a":"Salah","pt":"C","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-bi-8.4e2ce0","j":"bs","s":"Sara is reading a book.","a":"Salah","pt":"D","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-bi-8.de6969","j":"bs","s":"Amir is wearing black trousers.","a":"Betul","pt":"E","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]}],"petikan":{"A":{"t":"Text 1 — My Week","x":"My name is Daniel. On Mondays, I play football with my friends. On Wednesdays, I go swimming. On Saturdays, I ride my bike in the park. On Sundays, I read books at home. I like Saturdays best."},"B":{"t":"Text 2 — Grandma's House","x":"My grandma lives in an old house. There are three bedrooms and a big kitchen. There is a garden behind the house. In the garden, there are many flowers and a mango tree. I love my grandma's house."},"C":{"t":"Text 3 — The Robot","x":"Robo is a robot. He has got a square head and two long arms. He can walk and talk. He can't swim. Robo helps me clean my room. He is my best friend."},"D":{"t":"Text 4 — A Day at the Beach","x":"It is a hot day. Ali and Sara are at the beach. Ali has got a blue bucket and a spade. He is making a sandcastle. Sara is swimming in the sea. Their mother is under a big umbrella. She is reading a book."},"E":{"t":"Text 5 — New Clothes","x":"Today is Hari Raya. Aina is wearing a pink dress and white shoes. Her brother, Amir, is wearing a green shirt and black trousers. They visit their grandparents. Everyone is happy."}}}]}